its 'damdar', vows to wipe out BJP in UP]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/akhilesh-calls-dalits-damdar-vows-to-wipe-out-bjp-in-up/articleshow/135857266.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135857266.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav emphasized the importance of the Dalit community in upcoming Uttar Pradesh elections. He called for the ousting of the BJP government, highlighting the need for social justice. Akhilesh criticized the ruling party's record on Dalit issues, which includes the vandalism of Dr. BR Ambedkar's statues. He promised that a Samajwadi Party government would prioritize rights and education for marginalized communities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/akhilesh-calls-dalits-damdar-vows-to-wipe-out-bjp-in-up/articleshow/135857266.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/akhilesh-calls-dalits-damdar-vows-to-wipe-out-bjp-in-up/articleshow/135857266.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-15T19:15:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135857331,imgsize-147738.cms"/></item></channel></rss>